we optimized the main agent’s weights ΦM and θM as well as the catfish agent’s weights ΦCF

and θCF , whereby stimulation from the catfish agent enabled CDRL to acquire the optimal
policy. As shown in Fig. 4.10, during this phase the main agent performs only state-input
